  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueTrigger
  dialogueLines:
  - these stones have been here a long time.
  - longer than you can imagine.
  - each one carries a memory.
  - someone's fear.
  - someone's grief.
  - someone's last thought.
  - ...
  - don't worry.
  - yours isn't here yet.
